## Step 8: Test It RIGHT NOW!

1. Go to the **Actions** tab in your repository
2. Click on **Send Quarterly PPE Report** (left sidebar)
3. Click the **Run workflow** button (right side)
4. Click the green **Run workflow** button in the dropdown
5. Wait 30-60 seconds
6. Refresh the page
7. You should see a yellow dot (running) or green checkmark (success)
8. Click on the workflow run to see detailed logs
9. **Check your email!** You should receive the report with 2 Excel attachments

